From 141251f06a762e37ae789bd1f8bc954844963944 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:17:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] kcm: add a way to combine outputs into one playback device
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

There was no way in Plasma to play a stream on several chosen outputs at
once. Add "Combine Outputs…" to the Audio page, which creates a playback
device that plays on the checked devices, kept across logins by kded.

BUG: 440536
